{"study_accession":"PRJNA753626","secondary_study_accession":"SRP332201","title":"The differential analysis about N6-methyladenosine of COVID-19 and the health","description":"The outbreak of coronavirus disease 2019 (COVID-19) has affected more than 200 countries and regions to date. However, the mechanism of how SARS-CoV-2 function in COVID-19 patients is still unclear. We sequence m6A-seq from PBMC of COVID-19 patients. Our results showed that the expression level of m6A regulators decreased in COVID-19 patients and the m6A were also down-regulated in COVID-19 patients. We identified clinical features of COVID-19 patients related with m6A index. Our study demonstrated for the first time that RNA modification is associated with clinical feature of COVID-19 patients. Our conclusion will be valuable for the treatment of COVID-19 patients.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":16,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN20702542","study_accession":"PRJNA753626","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"Human sample from Homo sapiens","description":"Human sample from Homo sapiens","sex":"male","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2022-01-09","attributes":[["isolate","1"],["age","not collected"],["biomaterial_provider","Sanqi An"],["sex","male"],["tissue","PBMC"],["disease","health"],["health_state","health"],["population","human"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR15422537","experiment_accession":"SRX11724069","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"PCR","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000","read_count":51026433,"base_count":7205312045,"first_public":"2022-01-09","experiment_title":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000 sequencing: RNA-Seq of Homo sapiens: adult male PBMC"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN20702543","study_accession":"PRJNA753626","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"Human sample from Homo sapiens","description":"Human sample from Homo sapiens","sex":"male","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":